          "quote": "伤口持续出血、裂开、流脓，或红肿热痛向上扩散"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00080",
          "explanation": "The doctor asks about dressing change timing and wound appearance.",
          "quote": "外面敷料目前没看见一直渗血，也没看到脓，摸我爸额头也不烫，体温刚量是没到38"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was fully met by assessing wound, dressing, and infection signs, and giving escalation thresholds.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
